iling=2; policy.deductible=1000; claim_amount=3570.0"}],"points":[{"id":"D1","point":"The policy was active at the time of loss and included Collision coverage, which expressly covers damage from striking a stationary object.","evidence":"policy.start_date=2025-09-02; incident.date=2025-09-05; policy.coverages includes Collision"},{"id":"D2","point":"The repair estimate for bumper, tailgate, quarter panels, sensors and frame work reasonably totals $3,570, matching typical repair costs for this vehicle model.","evidence":"incident.damage lists those parts; claim_amount=3570.0; policy.vehicle_estimated_value=5100.0"},{"id":"D3","point":"The claimant has no prior claims and filed promptly, demonstrating good faith; the independent mechanic\u2019s estimate provides sufficient documentation despite the lack of photos.","evidence":"claim_history.prior_claims_count=0; timeline.days_incident_to_filing=2; supporting_documents includes repair estimate"}],"summary":"All factual elements confirm a genuine, covered loss: the policy was active, Collision coverage applies, the damage and repair cost are consistent with the incident, and the provided estimate is adequate evidence."}

